+the component-only `TR-COMPONENT`/`kind=component` path — whose exact CORE
+catalog row shape is not published in candidate25 and is named as an open
+dependency of the separate release/carrier work, not as an existing record.
+[Report asset binding](report-asset-binding.v1.json) owns the closed private
+schemas, the anchor comparison and the rejected alternatives. Use the selected
